<section class="card"><h2><?= e(t('Connection behavior')) ?></h2><p><?= e(t('LifeOS sends requests only when you connect, refresh or submit an action. Website management is an optional online feature. Your personal LifeOS modules continue to use local data.')) ?></p><p><?= e(t('Tokens and fetched records are encrypted for the current app session. Restarting or locking LifeOS clears access. HTTPS endpoints, certificate verification and version checks are required.')) ?></p></section>
